---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import AwardCard from "../../components/AwardCard.astro";
import Reviews from "../../components/Reviews.astro";
import faqs from "../../data/faqs.json";
import pages from "../../data/pages.json";
import collections from "../../data/collections.json";
import { awards, products, ranges, quoteUrl, MIN_QTY } from "../../lib/awards";
const meta = pages["glass-awards"];
const hasSamples = awards.some((a) => a.sample);
const PAGE = 48;
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description} path={meta.url} faqs={faqs["glass-awards"] ?? []} scripts={["awards.js"]}>
<section class="bg-navy px-6 py-10 text-white coll-hero-scene" style="--scene: url(/assets/img/hero/awards-night-1920.webp)">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <p class="m-0 mb-3 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: #F3A3A6">Glass &amp; crystal awards</p>
    <h1 class="m-0 mb-3 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight">Engraved glass &amp; crystal awards</h1>
    <p class="m-0 max-w-2xl text-lg" style="color: #D1D5DB">Bespoke glass and crystal awards, engraved with your logo and wording. Choose your awards and add them to your order, then check out with your wording. We reply within 24 hours with the full price, including engraving and delivery, and a free proof. Nothing to pay today.</p>
    <ul class="m-0 mt-5 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 p-0 font-semibold" style="color: #E5E7EB">
      <li>✓ Minimum order {MIN_QTY}</li><li>✓ Nothing to pay today</li><li>✓ Proof before we engrave</li><li>✓ Ready 10–14 working days after proof</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="aw-search mt-6" role="search">
      <label for="aw-q" class="sr-only">Search awards</label>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="aw-search-icon">⌕</span>
      <input id="aw-q" type="search" placeholder={`Search ${products.length} awards: try “star”, “blue crystal”, “golf” or a code`} autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search" />
      <kbd class="aw-kbd" aria-hidden="true">/</kbd>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 mt-3" style="color: #D1D5DB">Not sure where to start? <a href="/award-set-builder/" style="color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700">Build your set in 7 quick questions →</a> or <a href="/award-finder/" style="color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700">try the award finder</a>. Or add a few you like to your order, and we’ll quote them side by side.</p>
  </div>
  <span class="ai-tag">AI illustration</span>
</section>
{hasSamples && <p class="m-0 px-6 py-2 text-center text-sm font-bold" style="background: #FDECEC; color: #8A1C1C">Test products shown. Real catalogue coming soon.</p>}
<section class="bg-mist px-6 py-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="aw-ranges mb-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2" role="group" aria-label="Filter by range">
      <button type="button" class="opt pill" data-range="" aria-pressed="true">All awards</button>
      {ranges.map((r) => <button type="button" class="opt pill" data-range={r} aria-pressed="false">{r}</button>)}
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 mb-5 text-sm"><strong>Shop by occasion:</strong> {collections.filter((c) => c.kind === "occasion").map((c, i) => <>{i > 0 && " · "}<a href={`/${c.slug}/`}>{c.name}</a></>)}</p>
    <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p id="aw-count" class="m-0 font-semibold" aria-live="polite">{products.length} awards</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">Price
          <select id="aw-price" class="inp" style="width: auto">
            <option value="">Any price</option>
            <option value="0-20">Under £20</option>
            <option value="20-40">£20 to £40</option>
            <option value="40-75">£40 to £75</option>
            <option value="75-">£75 and over</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">Sort
          <select id="aw-sort" class="inp" style="width: auto">
            <option value="best">Best match</option>
            <option value="price-asc">Price: low to high</option>
            <option value="price-desc">Price: high to low</option>
            <option value="name">Name</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold"><input type="checkbox" id="aw-stock" /> In stock only</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul id="aw-grid" class="m-0 grid list-none gap-6 p-0" data-page={PAGE} style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(15.5rem, 1fr))">
      {products.map((p, i) => <AwardCard product={p} index={i} hidden={i >= PAGE} />)}
    </ul>
    <div id="aw-empty" class="rounded-lg bg-white p-8 text-center" hidden>
      <p class="m-0 mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-teal">No awards match that</p>
      <p class="muted m-0 mb-4">Try fewer words or another range. Or tell us what you’re after and we’ll find it.</p>
      <a class="btn" href={quoteUrl()}>Ask us to recommend</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 text-center"><button type="button" id="aw-more" class="btn ghost" hidden>Show more awards</button></p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-lg bg-white p-6">
      <div><p class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-teal">Not sure which one?</p><p class="muted m-0">Answer three quick questions in the award finder, or tell us what you need and we’ll recommend something.</p></div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="btn" href="/award-finder/">Try the award finder</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact/">Ask us to recommend</a></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted mt-6 text-sm">Prices are “from” prices per award. <strong>Engraving is £10.50 per position</strong> (text and/or your logo, e.g. the front), plus a flat <strong>£40 setup</strong> per order. UK delivery is quoted with your order. A guide price: orders of <strong>20 or more awards get a bulk discount</strong>, taken off in your quote.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bg-white px-6 py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="m-0 mb-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-teal">Engraved glass awards and glass trophies, made to order</h2>
    <p class="m-0 mb-4">Every award above is engraved by us in Cardiff with your logo, the award title and each winner’s name. Whether you call them glass awards, glass trophies or crystal awards, they’re bespoke to your event: you choose the shape and size, and we lay out the engraving and send a free proof before anything is engraved.</p>
    <div class="grid gap-6" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr))">
      <div><h3 class="m-0 mb-1 text-lg font-semibold">Glass or crystal?</h3><p class="m-0">Jade and clear glass awards are the lower-cost choice for category and team awards. Optical crystal is clearer and heavier, ideal for the headline award. <a href="/glass-vs-crystal-awards/">Compare glass and crystal</a>.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="m-0 mb-1 text-lg font-semibold">For companies, clubs and events</h3><p class="m-0">Staff awards nights, <a href="/long-service-awards/">long service</a>, <a href="/retirement-awards/">retirements</a>, <a href="/golf-awards/">golf days</a> and <a href="/corporate-awards/">corporate awards</a>. Minimum order {MIN_QTY} awards in total, in any mix.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="m-0 mb-1 text-lg font-semibold">Your logo and wording</h3><p class="m-0">Send your logo as a PDF, EPS or SVG and we set it up for engraving. Need help with the words? See our <a href="/award-wording-ideas/">award wording ideas</a>.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="m-0 mb-1 text-lg font-semibold">Lead times and delivery</h3><p class="m-0">Prices within 24 hours on working days. Awards are ready 10–14 working days after you approve the proof and delivered anywhere in the UK. Planning an event? See our <a href="/awards-night-planning/">awards night timeline</a>.</p></div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="m-0 mb-3 mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-teal">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    {(faqs["glass-awards"] ?? []).map((f, i) => <details class="py-4" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB" open={i === 0}><summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold">{f.q}</summary><p class="muted m-0 mt-2">{f.a}</p></details>)}
  </div>
</section>
<Reviews bg="#FFFFFF" />
</Base>
